WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.080
The most-mentioned
office-chair brand

2
00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:04.100
wasn't the first
comparative choice.

3
00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:06.900
In Recoscope's
November fifth snapshot,

4
00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:10.380
Branch appeared in eleven
of twelve usable answers.

5
00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:12.480
Steelcase appeared in nine.

6
00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:14.980
But all four comparative answers

7
00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:17.720
placed Steelcase first
and Herman Miller second.

8
00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.700
None placed Branch first.

9
00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:22.300
Ask for an office chair
under four hundred dollars,

10
00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:25.560
and Branch appeared in
all four budget answers.

11
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.680
Steelcase appeared in just one,

12
00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:29.280
as a refurbished alternative.

13
00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:31.400
These are captured mentions,

14
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:32.950
not verified prices.

15
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.560
For brand owners,
showing up often,

16
00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:37.400
showing up for a budget question,

17
00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:40.220
and being ranked first
are different measures.

18
00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:41.600
Track them separately.

19
00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:45.020
Captured answers do not
establish product quality.

20
00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:48.500
Explore benchmark at getrecoscope.com.

